          "settings": {
            "heading": "Will it work for my skin type?",
            "icon": "silhouette",
            "row_content": "<p>It's formulated to be non-irritating across dry, oily, combination and sensitive skin. If you're actively treating a skin condition, patch test on your inner arm for 24 hours first — as you would with any new product.</p>",
