          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What's in it — and what isn't?",
            "icon": "leaf",
            "row_content": "<p>Naturally derived actives, plant oils and humectants. No sulfates, parabens, synthetic fragrance, mineral oil or animal-derived ingredients. The full INCI list is printed on every carton.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "faq_layering": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Can I layer it with the rest of my routine?",
            "icon": "bottle",
            "row_content": "<p>Yes. Apply it to damp skin after cleansing and before moisturiser. It layers cleanly under SPF and makeup, and pairs with the rest of the Thessvane range without pilling.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "faq_shipping": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Shipping, returns and refills",
            "icon": "truck",
            "row_content": "<p>Orders ship within 1-2 business days. If it isn't right for your skin, return it within 30 days — opened or not — for a full refund. Refill pouches are available for every full-size bottle.</p>",
